field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8dccf2e7-d376-52ea-bc76-8b3e202c9087" :answer-field/choices ["answer-74d56b3e-7257-5d83-bd82-f6d95d76bf01" "answer-6df26438-d307-5393-ab8f-f12061c97708" "answer-8dccf2e7-d376-52ea-bc76-8b3e202c9087" "answer-6475c216-fc17-55dc-9d5c-a373d0c341f2" "answer-09e6872a-ded0-5a22-a963-179c8464b3aa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74d56b3e-7257-5d83-bd82-f6d95d76bf01" :answer/id #uuid "74d56b3e-7257-5d83-bd82-f6d95d76bf01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{1}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6df26438-d307-5393-ab8f-f12061c97708" :answer/id #uuid "6df26438-d307-5393-ab8f-f12061c97708" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8dccf2e7-d376-52ea-bc76-8b3e202c9087" :answer/id #uuid "8dccf2e7-d376-52ea-bc76-8b3e202c9087" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{3}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6475c216-fc17-55dc-9d5c-a373d0c341f2" :answer/id #uuid "6475c216-fc17-55dc-9d5c-a373d0c341f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{1}\\times \\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{4}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-09e6872a-ded0-5a22-a963-179c8464b3aa" :answer/id #uuid "09e6872a-ded0-5a22-a963-179c8464b3aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{1}\\times \\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{6}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-632bdc32-0439-5085-9d25-08594d5e1d55" :question/id #uuid "632bdc32-0439-5085-9d25-08594d5e1d55" :question/math-academy-id "q-211178" :question/problem "Insert the missing number in the multiplication problem below.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" height=\"100\" rules=\"all\" width=\"100\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"3\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\">$\\times $</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\">$=$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" height=\"100\" rules=\"all\" width=\"100\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "We have $\\frac{4}{5}$ on the left and $\\frac{8}{15}$ on the right.\n\n![](images/42/42e28264486cfa85290de0bad34ea6e0121fe77c00bc36003fedbca4ebcb1f46.png)\n\nThe shape on the right-hand side is split into $3$ equal parts by horizontal lines.\nSo, the shaded part on the right is $\\frac{2}{3}$ of the shaded part on the left. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\times \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{8}{15}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-93bc84f2-7405-56df-82d5-fb3b6f025c32"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-93bc84f2-7405-56df-82d5-fb3b6f025c32" :answer-field/id #uuid "93bc84f2-7405-56df-82d5-fb3b6f025c32" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-a79af833-d648-53bf-8e4e-9fd50ef181b1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a79af833-d648-53bf-8e4e-9fd50ef181b1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a79af833-d648-53bf-8e4e-9fd50ef181b1" :answer/id #uuid "a79af833-d648-53bf-8e4e-9fd50ef181b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-077086cd-6950-5cf9-9941-247f49a033f6" :question/id #uuid "077086cd-6950-5cf9-9941-247f49a033f6" :question/math-academy-id "q-211185" :question/problem "Insert the missing number in the multiplication problem below.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" height=\"100\" rules=\"all\" width=\"100\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"3\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\">$\\times $</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\">$=$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" height=\"100\" rules=\"all\" width=\"100\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "We have $\\frac{2}{6}$ on the left and $\\frac{6}{24}$ on the right.\n\n![](images/91/918db9e617e1830739d91a5799f7862a56f988f9b5dc6ead60f1cdc41d332867.png)\n\nThe shape on the right-hand side is split into $4$ equal parts by horizontal lines.\nSo, the shaded part on the right is $\\frac{3}{4}$ of the shaded part on the left. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{6}\\times \\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{6}{24}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c14853e8-51e2-5b70-8fb2-0c912fa334d7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c14853e8-51e2-5b70-8fb2-0c912fa334d7" :answer-field/id #uuid "c14853e8-51e2-5b70-8fb2-0c912fa334d7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-659a502a-fce5-558c-8a15-8bce80fe135d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-659a502a-fce5-558c-8a15-8bce80fe135d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-659a502a-fce5-558c-8a15-8bce80fe135d" :answer/id #uuid "659a502a-fce5-558c-8a15-8bce80fe135d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-38177e16-9481-59a0-81e0-6e58dd2d54cc" :question/id #uuid "38177e16-9481-59a0-81e0-6e58dd2d54cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-60311" :question/problem "![](images/a8/a817636d0f243a14eac09fe175beba71d0a1311c86ec86808600ed31ab49622d.png)\n\nWhat picture is missing from the multiplication model above?" :question/worked-solution "In the model, we have $\\frac{2}{5}$ on the left.\n\nSince we need to multiply by $\\frac{3}{4}$, we split the whole into $4$ equal parts horizontally and ensure that $3$ of the parts remain shaded.\n\n![](images/7f/7f79cdedc4fe020369e25f271769304093f7a92be0f507bb54a566ba2b4c3ce8.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{6}{20}$ of the whole.\n\nTherefore, the missing picture is as follows:\n\n![](images/6b/6b680d4914abad66b0fb3dd1ee9285a0c00916787b64641eb473fda2366a8053.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-29a6807a-be17-5991-90b4-9b3edb88db87"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-29a6807a-be17-5991-90b4-9b3edb88db87" :answer-field/id #uuid "29a6807a-be17-5991-90b4-9b3edb88db87" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d651a616-720a-5356-b16a-dec6db9c7e5c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-36e3a374-da67-5588-98f5-6e99edd0ac6a" "answer-808463b2-7a31-5a5